      "page_number": 1,
      "page_count": 2,
      "visible_lines": [
        "Military Investment",
        "Invest in the town's defenses in groups",
        "of 1 to 20 units. Each unit costs gold",
        "equal to 50 percent of the town's",
        "Arms rating, or 40 percent for Rafael.",
        "Continue reading"
      ],
      "links": [
        {
          "label": "Continue reading",
          "id": 204,
          "navigation": true,
          "row": 5
        }
      ],
      "bytes": 197,
      "encoded_hex": ""
    },
    {
      "topic_id": 204,
      "source_article_id": 37,
      "page_number": 2,
      "page_count": 2,
      "visible_lines": [
        "Military Investment (continued)",
        "Investment raises the town's Arms rating.",
        "Your market share also rises if the total",
        "is below 100 percent or a faction you are",
        "at war with holds a share. A higher",
        "Arms rating makes a town less likely to",
        "surrender when attacked and lets you buy",
        "better ships and cannons.",
        "Back to article start"
      ],
      "links": [
        {
          "label": " market share",
          "id": 150,
          "navigation": false,
          "row": 2
        },
