    },
    {
      "topic_id": 38,
      "source_article_id": 38,
      "page_number": 1,
      "page_count": 2,
      "visible_lines": [
        "Introduction (Palace)",
        "Give the ruler or governor a",
        "Letter of Introduction from the Market.",
        "You can use it only in Ports. If you",
        "already have a contract, your",
        "market share rises by",
        "5 percentage points. Otherwise, the",
        "letter lets you sign a contract.",
        "Continue reading"
      ],
