      "page_number": 2,
      "page_count": 2,
      "visible_lines": [
        "Introduction (continued)",
        "You can sign even if other factions hold",
        "a combined 100 percent share. In that",
        "case, you take 1 percentage point from",
        "those factions. You cannot use the letter",
        "if the town already has contracts with",
        "three factions or your faction holds a",
        "100 percent share.",
        "Back to article start"
      ],
